 record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle had February to March at 17% of normal and August to September at 166%. So far in 2026 the middle shows February to March at 6% and March to April at 17%. Every grid had its driest year in 1956, and grid 20818 fell to 33% in 1956.</p>"}
